{
    "title": "Local Weather Forecast& Widget",
    "description": "Local weather forecast, your personal life assistant; provide accurate real-time weather, hourly forecast, daily forecast, radar map and all the weather forecast information you need.\r\n\r\n****Main Features of Local Weather ****\r\n\r\n\u2728 <b>Real-time weather and Weather Alert</b>\r\nAffected area, start time, end time, alert summary, alert text, and data source. Alerts in different colors represent different levels.\r\n\r\n\u2728 <b>The next 24/72 hours weather forecast</b>\r\nBeautiful temperature curve graphics, each hour will provide temperature, Real feel temperature, weather briefing, humidity, UV index, visibility, Dew point, rainfall/snowfall/icing probability, wind direction/wind speed/wind level, cloud cover.\r\n\r\n\u2728 <b>The weather forecast for the next 10/25 days</b>\r\nBeautiful hyperbolic temperature change curve graph, providing daily maximum and minimum temperature, Real feel temperature, weather brief description, humidity, ultraviolet index, rainfall/snowfall/icing probability, lightning probability, wind direction/wind speed/wind level, sunrise/ Sunset time.\r\n\r\n\u2728 <b>Today's weather details</b>\r\nProvide Real feel temperature, sunrise and sunset, humidity, ultraviolet light, visibility, dew point, altitude, cloud cover.\r\n\r\n\u2728 <b>Air Quality Index</b>\r\nAir quality level and travel recommendations, specific indexes include PM10, PM2.5, carbon monoxide, nitrogen dioxide, sulfur dioxide, ozone, and quality level.\r\nProvide explanations and suggestions for different levels of air quality index.\r\n\r\n\u2728 <b>Real-time weather radar cloud map</b>\r\nCan display a variety of radar cloud images, very convenient and quick to browse weather forecast information.\r\n\r\n\u2728 <b>City Management</b>\r\nAutomatically locate the current location, provide manual addition and removal of cities, set the order of the city list; search for specified cities, and support fuzzy search.\r\n\r\n\u2728 <b>Theme style</b>\r\nIcons and backgrounds for different weather; notification bar styles with different layout styles; widget styles for different layout styles.\r\nSupport custom weather background, choose the picture on your mobile device.\r\n\r\n\u2728 <b>Weather information unit and format setting</b>\r\nTemperature unit\u3001Precipitation units\u3001Visibility units\u3001Wind speed unit\u3001Pressure unit\u3001Hour format\u3001Date format\r\n\r\n\u2728 <b>Suggestions and feedback</b>\r\nDuring the use process, any suggestions and comments can be directly fed back to us, or contact the e-mail address below.\r\n\r\n\u2728 <b>Support multiple languages</b>\r\n\r\nDownload it now and experience the real-time and accurate weather forecast.\r\n\r\nLife assistant, from now on to be with you.\r\n\r\nIn the course of use, if there are any questions or suggestions, please feedback to us at any time through the following mailbox, we will try our best to provide a better experience.\r\ne-mail:\r\nLifeAssistantStudio@outlook.com",
    "descriptionHTML": "Local weather forecast, your personal life assistant; provide accurate real-time weather, hourly forecast, daily forecast, radar map and all the weather forecast information you need.<br><br>****Main Features of Local Weather ****<br><br>\u2728 <b>Real-time weather and Weather Alert</b><br>Affected area, start time, end time, alert summary, alert text, and data source. Alerts in different colors represent different levels.<br><br>\u2728 <b>The next 24/72 hours weather forecast</b><br>Beautiful temperature curve graphics, each hour will provide temperature, Real feel temperature, weather briefing, humidity, UV index, visibility, Dew point, rainfall/snowfall/icing probability, wind direction/wind speed/wind level, cloud cover.<br><br>\u2728 <b>The weather forecast for the next 10/25 days</b><br>Beautiful hyperbolic temperature change curve graph, providing daily maximum and minimum temperature, Real feel temperature, weather brief description, humidity, ultraviolet index, rainfall/snowfall/icing probability, lightning probability, wind direction/wind speed/wind level, sunrise/ Sunset time.<br><br>\u2728 <b>Today&#39;s weather details</b><br>Provide Real feel temperature, sunrise and sunset, humidity, ultraviolet light, visibility, dew point, altitude, cloud cover.<br><br>\u2728 <b>Air Quality Index</b><br>Air quality level and travel recommendations, specific indexes include PM10, PM2.5, carbon monoxide, nitrogen dioxide, sulfur dioxide, ozone, and quality level.<br>Provide explanations and suggestions for different levels of air quality index.<br><br>\u2728 <b>Real-time weather radar cloud map</b><br>Can display a variety of radar cloud images, very convenient and quick to browse weather forecast information.<br><br>\u2728 <b>City Management</b><br>Automatically locate the current location, provide manual addition and removal of cities, set the order of the city list; search for specified cities, and support fuzzy search.<br><br>\u2728 <b>Theme style</b><br>Icons and backgrounds for different weather; notification bar styles with different layout styles; widget styles for different layout styles.<br>Support custom weather background, choose the picture on your mobile device.<br><br>\u2728 <b>Weather information unit and format setting</b><br>Temperature unit\u3001Precipitation units\u3001Visibility units\u3001Wind speed unit\u3001Pressure unit\u3001Hour format\u3001Date format<br><br>\u2728 <b>Suggestions and feedback</b><br>During the use process, any suggestions and comments can be directly fed back to us, or contact the e-mail address below.<br><br>\u2728 <b>Support multiple languages</b><br><br>Download it now and experience the real-time and accurate weather forecast.<br><br>Life assistant, from now on to be with you.<br><br>In the course of use, if there are any questions or suggestions, please feedback to us at any time through the following mailbox, we will try our best to provide a better experience.<br>e-mail:<br>LifeAssistantStudio@outlook.com",
